      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "NOT0",
        "Description": "NOT reading (input A, BIAS constantly on, threshold 0.375) of the shipped 'Logic Gate NOT-NAND' gate. Role in the 4-bit NOT: bit slice 0 of the ISA NOT datapath — Y0 = NOT A0. The 4-bit word operation composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate's truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each slice restores clean 0/1 levels by construction and the four slices run side by side without a single wire between them.",
